WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Rohan: Thanks everyone. Today is the pre-order launch plan for the 2027 season.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Meera: The landing page is ready. Pre-orders open on 1 February with 10% off for returning customers.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Priya: Courier rates went up. Bluedart quoted ₹95 per box, the current partner is ₹82. I'd say we stay with the current partner for now.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Rohan: Agreed, we stay with the current courier this season. Priya, can you confirm their capacity for 2,000 boxes in March by 15 January?

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Priya: Yes, I'll get that in writing by 15 January.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Meera: I'll send the email to past customers on 1 February, and the WhatsApp broadcast the same day.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Rohan: Good. One open point: do we offer the box of 24 to offices? Let's decide next week. Same time next Friday, 16 January.
